{"seq":3,"slug":"destruction-model","title":"破坏的数据与状态模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/foundations/destruction-model","wordCount":1769,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"破坏的数据与状态模型\">破坏的数据与状态模型</h1><p>当你打开引擎的破坏系统源码，会发现真正复杂的不是切割算法，而是「一个会坏的东西」到底该用什么数据结构表达、它有哪些状态、损伤怎么在系统间流动。这篇给出一套贯穿全 hub 的抽象模型——后面碎裂、模拟、网络各章反复出现的「几何集合」「损伤事件」「锚点」「碎块簇」等术语，都在这里定义。把这套模型建立起来，读后续代码就不再是猜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>破坏系统的核心抽象是<strong>几何集合</strong>（Geometry Collection）：把一整个可破坏体打包为碎块列表、描述碎块间连接的<strong>断裂连接图</strong>、标记钉死在世界上的<strong>锚点</strong>，以及多级碎块的层次树。围绕它有三个必须建立的模型：<strong>三层表示</strong>——同一物体同时有渲染网格、碰撞代理、破坏拓扑三套表示，LOD 就是在不同距离切换三者的精度；<strong>损伤事件流</strong>——破坏不是一次性的，而是损伤事件按空间累积、超过材料阈值才触发断裂；<strong>破坏状态机</strong>——可破坏体沿完好→受损→部分脱落→完全解体→碎屑清理单向迁移，每次迁移可能派生出新的独立刚体。其中最重要的一条设计原则是：<strong>损伤累积（玩法数值）与几何断裂（物理拓扑）必须解耦</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可破坏体的三层表示\">可破坏体的三层表示</h2><p>一个可破坏体在内存里通常有三层同时存在的表示，各自服务不同目的，混淆它们是新手常见的困惑来源。</p>\n<p><strong>渲染表示</strong>是玩家看到的网格，追求视觉细节，可能有很高的面数与材质。<strong>碰撞表示</strong>是物理引擎用的近似形状（凸包、盒、球的组合），追求求解速度，通常远比渲染网格简单。<strong>破坏拓扑表示</strong>才是破坏系统的核心：它把物体记录为一组碎块（chunk）加一张描述碎块间连接的图。三者通过映射关联：每个碎块同时持有自己的渲染子网格、碰撞代理和在拓扑图中的节点。</p>\n<p>这套分层与<a href=\"../simulation/debris-physics\">碎块物理</a>里碰撞代理的选择、以及<a href=\"../simulation/debris-management\">碎屑管理与 LOD</a>里的低精度替换直接相关：LOD 本质上就是在不同距离下切换这三层表示的精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"几何集合-碎块与连接图的容器\">几何集合：碎块与连接图的容器</h2><p>把一整个可破坏体的破坏拓扑打包在一起的数据结构，业界通称<strong>几何集合</strong>（Geometry Collection，UE5 术语；其它引擎叫 fracture asset 或 destructible mesh）。它至少包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>被谁消费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>chunks[]</td>\n<td>碎块列表，每块含几何、质量、局部变换</td>\n<td>物理模拟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>connections[]</td>\n<td>碎块间连接边，含连接强度</td>\n<td>应力传播、约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>anchors[]</td>\n<td>锚点碎块，钉死在世界不受重力</td>\n<td>坍塌判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hierarchy</td>\n<td>多级碎块的父子树（预断裂时）</td>\n<td>层次化解体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>initialState</td>\n<td>初始是完整刚体还是已休眠碎块簇</td>\n<td>激活逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 <code>anchors</code>（锚点）是坍塌逻辑的支点：一个碎块只有通过连接图上一条路径连到某个锚点，才被认为「有支撑」；一旦这条路径被断裂切断，它就会失去支撑而下落。这条规则是<a href=\"../fracture/fracture-graph\">断裂连接图</a>与<a href=\"../fracture/stress-propagation\">应力传播</a>两篇的核心，这里先埋下定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"损伤事件流\">损伤事件流</h2><p>破坏不是「一次性把物体炸了」，而是<strong>损伤事件</strong>不断累积、达到阈值才触发状态迁移的过程。一个损伤事件通常携带：施力点位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9774em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0688em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、强度（可折算为冲量或能量）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span>、以及半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（用于范围伤害的衰减）。</p>\n<p>系统把事件按空间映射到受影响的碎块，为每块累加损伤值。以爆炸为例，位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9084em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、能量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的爆炸对距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 处碎块施加的损伤常用平方反比衰减建模：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D = E_0 \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\max(r^2, r_0^2)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2737em;vertical-align:-0.9523em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4337em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2663em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9523em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是避免除零的最小半径。当某碎块累计损伤 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 超过其材料阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>th</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{th}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">th</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，与它相连的连接边开始断裂——这才把损伤转化为拓扑变化。这套「事件→累积→阈值→断裂」的流水线，把玩法层（谁开了枪）与模拟层（哪块脱落）解耦，是破坏系统能同时接入子弹、爆炸、碰撞等多种伤害源的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[损伤源: 子弹/爆炸/碰撞] --&gt; B[损伤事件&lt;br/&gt;位置+方向+强度+半径]&#10;  B --&gt; C[空间映射到受影响碎块]&#10;  C --&gt; D[逐块累积损伤值]&#10;  D --&gt; E{累积 &gt;= 阈值?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[保持连接&lt;br/&gt;仅记录损伤]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[断裂相关连接边]&#10;  G --&gt; H[连接图连通性变化]&#10;  H --&gt; I{仍连到锚点?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[局部裂痕&lt;br/&gt;物体仍站立]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[失去支撑&lt;br/&gt;释放为动态碎块]\">flowchart TD\n  A[损伤源: 子弹/爆炸/碰撞] --&gt; B[损伤事件&lt;br/&gt;位置+方向+强度+半径]\n  B --&gt; C[空间映射到受影响碎块]\n  C --&gt; D[逐块累积损伤值]\n  D --&gt; E{累积 &gt;= 阈值?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[保持连接&lt;br/&gt;仅记录损伤]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[断裂相关连接边]\n  G --&gt; H[连接图连通性变化]\n  H --&gt; I{仍连到锚点?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[局部裂痕&lt;br/&gt;物体仍站立]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[失去支撑&lt;br/&gt;释放为动态碎块]</pre><h2 id=\"破坏状态机\">破坏状态机</h2><p>从整个可破坏体的视角，它在生命周期里经历几个离散状态，理清这个状态机能避免大量边界 bug（比如「已经碎了还在收损伤」）。</p>\n<p>一个可破坏体典型的状态迁移是：<strong>完好（intact）</strong>→ 受损但站立**（damaged）<strong>→ 部分脱落</strong>（partial）<strong>→ 完全解体</strong>（shattered）<strong>→ 碎屑清理</strong>（cleanup）**。关键约束有两条：一是状态只能单向前进，不能「自愈」（除非游戏显式支持修复）；二是每次迁移都可能派生出新的独立动态刚体，这些新刚体从此脱离原几何集合、由物理系统单独管理，也从此成为<a href=\"../simulation/debris-management\">碎屑管理</a>的对象。</p>\n<p>状态机还决定了性能特征：<code>intact</code> 状态几乎零开销（就是个静态网格），<code>shattered</code> 到 <code>cleanup</code> 之间才是 CPU 峰值。因此性能优化的一大策略就是缩短高开销状态的停留时间——这正是<a href=\"../practice/destruction-performance\">性能与预算</a>里碎屑快速淡出的动机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"损伤与断裂的解耦\">损伤与断裂的解耦</h2><p>最后强调一个容易忽略的设计原则：<strong>损伤累积</strong>与<strong>几何断裂</strong>应当是两套解耦的系统。损伤是玩法可调的数值（多少血、多强的甲），断裂是物理触发的拓扑变化。把它们混在一起，会导致「想调平衡就得重烘焙几何」的灾难。良好的模型里，玩法层只操作损伤值和阈值，几何拓扑一次烘焙后不再改动。这个解耦让策划能自由调破坏难度而不惊动美术管线，也让同一套几何集合服务于不同难度设定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>可破坏体有渲染、碰撞、破坏拓扑三层表示，LOD 就是在不同距离切换三层的精度。</li>\n<li>几何集合打包碎块、连接、锚点、层次；锚点是坍塌判定的支点——连不到锚点即失去支撑。</li>\n<li>损伤走「事件→按空间累积→超阈值断裂→连通性变化→失支撑释放」的流水线，把玩法层与模拟层解耦。</li>\n<li>可破坏体沿 intact→damaged→partial→shattered→cleanup 单向迁移，CPU 峰值集中在解体到清理之间。</li>\n<li>损伤累积（玩法数值）与几何断裂（物理拓扑）必须解耦，否则调平衡就得重烘焙。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章前两篇打底：<a href=\"why-destruction\">为何要做破坏系统</a>、<a href=\"prefractured-vs-dynamic\">预断裂与动态破坏</a></li>\n<li>连接图与锚点的具体构建：<a href=\"../fracture/fracture-graph\">断裂连接图</a></li>\n<li>跨库：损伤事件本质是一种游戏状态，其同步机制见 <a href=\"../../game-networking/state-synchronization/state-replication\">游戏网络 · 状态复制</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"破坏的数据与状态模型","id":"破坏的数据与状态模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可破坏体的三层表示","id":"可破坏体的三层表示"},{"level":2,"text":"几何集合：碎块与连接图的容器","id":"几何集合-碎块与连接图的容器"},{"level":2,"text":"损伤事件流","id":"损伤事件流"},{"level":2,"text":"破坏状态机","id":"破坏状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"损伤与断裂的解耦","id":"损伤与断裂的解耦"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"预断裂与动态破坏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/foundations/prefractured-vs-dynamic"},"next":{"title":"Voronoi 碎裂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-destruction-systems/fracture/voronoi-fracture"}}